{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"screen\": \"沉默也很舒服，心却慢慢漂远。\",\n      \"source\": \"也可以想成亲密交谈后忽然安静下来：沉默并不尴尬，反而很舒服；身体还在这里，心却已经慢慢漂远。\",\n      \"type\": \"6\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿将心慢慢漂远明确作为一种可供想象的听感，屏幕稿却把它接入他的叙事，变成他实际的心理状态。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"screen\": \"白天和某个人相处得很好，独处时心头却泛酸。\",\n      \"source\": \"白天明明和某个人相处得很好，晚上回到家后，心头却泛起一阵酸楚。独处把幽微的感受放大了。\",\n      \"type\": \"8\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"把具体的“晚上回到家后”泛化成“独处时”，改变了原本明确的时间和场景范围。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"screen\": \"紧绷的肩膀终于松开，胸腔打开。\",\n      \"source\": \"先前那阵紧绷慢慢松下去。像一直微微绷着肩膀的人，终于长长呼出一口气，胸腔一下打开。\",\n      \"type\": \"6\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"把珠子里的肩膀和胸腔的比喻直接写成他的实际身体动作，定稿线只说内心的紧绷感慢慢松下。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c314811c-9f84-4fe1-8e80-dd031d87cf27", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T065814044434Z", "elapsed_seconds": 336.031, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T07:03:50.089466+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "000dc6f77fdc7aa44f303f921f89c188b931d381a8e21189a71a5135bbd043a7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_star